        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2129] If in the supportedAppProtocolReq, an energy transfer mode is offered based on ISO 15118-20, all features implemented for this energy transfer mode in older generations of the document still need to be supported for ISO 15118-20.",
